{
  "label": "Quick Start",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Quick Start",
      "id": "quick-start",
      "intro": "Mulai gunakan Alert Acquirer dalam 5 langkah. Perkiraan waktu: 5 menit.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Akses Halaman Alert Acquirer",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik menu **Alert Acquirer** di sidebar navigasi\n• Halaman akan menampilkan daftar alert terbaru\n• Default view menampilkan semua klasifikasi",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#f59e0b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0zM12 9v4m0 4h.01\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Acquirer</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Monitor alerts generated by the acquirer</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:9px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\">All</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:9px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Not Fraud</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:9px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Suspicious</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:9px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Fraud</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Filter Berdasarkan Klasifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **All** — Tampilkan semua alert tanpa filter\n• **Not Fraud (NEGATIVE)** — Alert yang bukan fraud\n• **Suspicious** — Alert yang perlu review lebih lanjut\n• **Fraud (POSITIVE)** — Alert fraud yang terdeteksi\n• Klik tab untuk switch antar klasifikasi",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;padding:12px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:2px solid #3b82f6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eff6ff,#fff);padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e3a8a;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\">All</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;background:#f0fdf4;padding:8px;opacity:.8;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#14532d;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Not Fraud</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;background:#fffbeb;padding:8px;opacity:.8;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#78350f;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Suspicious</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #fecaca;background:#fef2f2;padding:8px;opacity:.8;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#7f1d1d;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Fraud</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Gunakan Advanced Search",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Filter** di pojok kanan atas\n• Filter tersedia:\n  - Date Range (dari - sampai)\n  - Alert ID / UTRNNO\n  - Customer Name / Card Number\n  - Merchant Name / MID\n  - Amount Range\n• Klik **Apply** untuk terapkan filter",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 3h2l.4 2M7 13h10l4-8H5.4M7 13L5.4 5M7 13l-2.293 2.293c-.63.63-.184 1.707.707 1.707H17m0 0a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zm-8 2a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Advanced Search</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Date Range</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">01/01/2024 - 31/01/2024</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Amount Range</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Rp 0 - Rp 10,000,000</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Lihat Detail Alert",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik baris alert untuk buka detail\n• Detail mencakup 4 tab:\n  - **Alert Detail** — Info alert & klasifikasi\n  - **Transaction** — Detail transaksi terkait\n  - **Triggered Rule** — Rule yang memicu alert\n  - **Discussion** — Kolaborasi tim\n  - **Transaction History** — Riwayat transaksi customer",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:6px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Detail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">Alert Detail</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Transaction</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Triggered Rule</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Discussion</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Kelola Alert (Lock/Action)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Lock Alert** — Lock alert untuk penanganan eksklusif\n• **Unlock Alert** — Release lock agar tim lain bisa handle\n• **Bulk Operations** — Lock/unlock beberapa alert sekaligus\n• **Action Request** — Escalate atau resolve alert via action request\n• Alert yang ter-lock akan ditampilkan dengan indicator visual",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:6px;background:#14b8a6;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Lock Management</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#14b8a6;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">🔒 Lock Alert</span><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;\">🔓 Unlock Alert</span><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Operations</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
